  ('2fab0ed8-270b-4496-b98f-3148dc7c0508', (select id from auth.users where email = 'a@a.com'), 'ZT 8 Week', '8-week block, 6-day week (Day 4 is always low-impact cardio + yoga/stretching recovery). Weeks 1-3 are transcribed from the source PDFs; Weeks 4-8 continue the same structure and periodization pattern (deload -> loading -> intensification -> peak -> taper/test) as authored in docs/research/zt-8-week.md.', false, false);
